	(text "EV.6.1.5\nA: Minimum height and width is satisfied (see PCB editor)\n	- Green & Red: 26.416x17.272 mm\n	- Amber: 39.116x17.272 mm\nC: Distance\n	- Green to Red: 6.604mm\n	- Green & Red to Amber: 6.35mm\nD: Center \n	- All LED's smallest illuminated dimension is 2.40mm in diameter\n	- All LED distance is 7.112mm\nE: Visibility\n	- Each LED's brightness is sufficient to visible in direct sunlight\n	- Green: 5000 mcd\n	- Red: 2750 mcd\n	- Amber: 3370 mcd\n	- The brightness differes, but it doesn't matter because only LED will be on at a time."
